0..72 Comment "// A coherence cell: a rule between rules, its source a composite of two"
73..149 Comment "// laws spelled with `then`. The laws here nest no operation, so the cell is"
150..198 Comment "// the only member the cell layer does not read."
199..201 Comment "//"
202..268 Comment "// A category\'s own triangle and pentagon, over the composition of"
269..341 Comment "// `cat-shape.gandr`, return here once the cell layer reads an operation"
342..369 Comment "// nested in a law (#1510):"
370..372 Comment "//"
373..437 Comment "//   rule triangle : (assoc(f, id(b), g) then comp(f, unitL(g)))"
438..467 Comment "//     ==> comp(unitR(f), g);"
468..543 Comment "//   rule pentagon : (assoc(comp(f, g), h, k) then assoc(f, g, comp(h, k)))"
544..639 Comment "//     ==> (comp(assoc(f, g, h), k) then assoc(f, comp(g, h), k) then comp(f, assoc(g, h, k)));"
641..712 Comment "/// Two steps and the shortcut between their ends: the cell relates the"
713..756 Comment "/// composite of the steps to the shortcut."
